WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.834 --> 00:00:02.252
Linus, wake up,

00:00:02.252 --> 00:00:04.337
I'm going to throw a party.

00:00:04.337 --> 00:00:05.505
Everyone should dress up.

00:00:07.090 --> 00:00:09.300
And at midnight I want someone to sing that

00:00:09.551 --> 00:00:11.469
New Year's song that people always sing.

00:00:11.636 --> 00:00:12.470
Auld Lang Syne?

00:00:12.470 --> 00:00:13.513
That's the one.

00:00:13.930 --> 00:00:14.639
Five,

00:00:14.973 --> 00:00:15.557
four,

00:00:15.974 --> 00:00:16.641
three,

00:00:17.017 --> 00:00:17.726
two,

00:00:17.976 --> 00:00:18.643
one...

00:00:19.102 --> 00:00:21.312
happy New Year!

00:00:26.234 --> 00:00:30.613
(song) &lt;i&gt;Should auld acquaintance be forgot&lt;/i&gt;

00:00:30.822 --> 00:00:34.701
&lt;i&gt;and never brought to mind?&lt;/i&gt;

