&lt;i&gt;Should auld acquaintance be forgot&lt;/i&gt;

00:00:39.664 --> 00:00:43.835
&lt;i&gt;and days of auld lang syne?&lt;/i&gt;

00:00:44.085 --> 00:00:48.548
&lt;i&gt;For auld lang syne, my dear&lt;/i&gt;

